    ],
    "text": "The following Land situated in the Village of Hittetiya Center in the Matara Divisional Secretariat Division, Matara District, Southern Province and depicted as Lot No. 01 and 02 in Primary Plan Mara 2722 has been acquired to be widening Matara Hittetiya Medagedara Watta Road.",
