      187.04,
      294.82,
      277.76
    ],
    "text": "Schedule 01. Lot No. : 1 Name of the land : Rathuralage Watta alias Ampitiya Watta alias Kongahahena ; Description: Garden with mixed crops; Claimant: Hewa Nalagamage Nishantha, No. 86, D. D. Dahanayake, Hittetiya Center, Matara; Extent: 0.0038 Hectare.",
